{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36448","headline":"趂职单于留别阙下知己 · 罗邺","name":"趂职单于留别阙下知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"职忝翩翩逐建牙，笈随征骑入胡沙。\n定将千里书凭雁，应看三春雪当花。\n年长有心终报国，时清到处便营家。\n逢秋不拟同张翰，爲忆鲈鱼却叹嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}